From 6c540aa1d849630d25b1fb94a9663aad647137b1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Mon, 3 Aug 2026 09:33:23 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] reaper v2.1.2: Merlin 3006.102.8 carry-forward (version bump)

v2.1.2 = v2.1.1 + 19 upstream Asuswrt-Merlin commits cherry-picked from the
3006.102.8 / 3006.102.8_2 production releases (base stays pinned at
3006.102.8-beta2 a7ebfa133a; each carried commit retains upstream authorship
and an "(cherry picked from ...)" trailer for provenance). No owner code
changes in this rung - pure upstream carry-forward. Highlights:

- OpenVPN updated to 2.7.5 (2.7 line; deprecated server features removed -
  metal-test any OpenVPN server config after flashing).
- dropbear updated to 2026.94; strongswan build recipes synced (fixes a
  missing exe); miniupnpd updated to 2.3.10-g91eeeae + default
  upnp_ssdp_interval 900s.
- IPv6 LAN/WAN prefix handling: clamp delegated prefix to /64 where
  appropriate (non-multilan / no-SDN paths; largely inert on this
  MULTILAN_MWL+SDN model), correct prefix-length reporting in the LAN IPv6
  status, and rework of the user-defined IPv6 WAN prefix.
- webui: client-list re-render replaced with an incremental DOM diff; DHCP
  export works on iOS; Traffic Analyzer availability decoupled from bwdpi;
  obsolete USB-modem tweak removed; restart mastiff when toggling the Asusnat
  tunnel.
- rc: dhcpc-event script runs at the end of the event; DDNS sets the IPv6
  updated flag on a successful custom update.

Dropped as N/A for RT-BE96U: UI4 Wireless-Log popup (BE96U isn't UI4),
OpenSSL 3.5.7 (GT-BE19000AI only), RT-BE88U build-profile fix (carried onto
the rt-be88u branch during fan-out), and minor stock-chart cosmetics.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 release/src-rt/version.conf | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/release/src-rt/version.conf b/release/src-rt/version.conf
index c84e6d362e..b1a1a0a6f2 100644
--- a/release/src-rt/version.conf
+++ b/release/src-rt/version.conf
@@ -4,6 +4,6 @@ KERNEL_VER_AM=$(subst .,,$(KERNEL_VER))
 FS_VER_AM=$(subst .,,$(FS_VER))
 
 SERIALNO=102.8
-EXTENDNO=Reaper_v2.1.1
+EXTENDNO=Reaper_v2.1.2
 
 RCNO=0
-- 
2.25.1

